the person or thing you are talking about.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "The demonstratives are: <span class=\"strong\"> this, that, these</span> and <span class=\"strong\"> those</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Demonstratives tell us about number (singular or plural) and distance (near or far).", "type": "text"}, {"content": "There are <span class=\"italic\"> demonstrative adjectives</span> and <span class=\"italic\"> demonstrative pronouns</span>. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "A demonstrative adjective tells us about the noun. It comes before the noun.<br /> <span class=\"italic\"> <span class=\"strong\"> This</span> potato is good.  <span class=\"strong\">That</span> potato is bad. <br/>I like <span class=\"strong\"> those</span> sweet potatoes. <span class=\"strong\"> These</span> large onions are on sale for $2.00 a pound. </span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "A demonstrative pronoun replaces a noun. It is on its own. <br /> <span class=\"italic\"> <span class=\"strong\"> This</span> is good.  <span class=\"strong\">That</span> is bad. <br/>I like <span class=\"strong\"> these</span>. I bake <span class=\"strong\"> those</span> once a month. </span> ", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Asking Questions at the Supermarket", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You can ask questions at the supermarket when you want to find something. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":\"02\",\"columns\":\"02\",\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Questions</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Examples </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Can you tell me where ... ?   <br />Where can I find ... ?  <br />Do you have any ... (in stock)?  <br />I am looking for (a) ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Can you tell where the sweet potatoes are?<br />  Where can I find potatoes? <br /> Do you have any onions in stock? <br /> I am looking for the apples on sale for $1.00. <br /> </span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "ingredient  ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a food item used to prepare a dish", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I am looking for ingredients.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le04ob11aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are the words to review. ", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "dish   ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "food that is prepared in a certain way ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I want to make a meat dish.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le04ob11aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to cook ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to prepare food to eat ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I love to cook.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le04ob11aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "recipe", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a set of instructions you use to make a certain dish ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The recipe calls for beef.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le04ob11aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "aisle ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "organized shelves for food or items ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The meat is in that aisle.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le04ob11aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"typ