a</span>:      Yes. I am looking for ingredients for a meat dish.", "image": "engenn2le04ob11re2img01.jpg", "id": 1, "time": "10"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Clerk</span>:      Do you like cooking? What ingredients?<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Chelsea</span>:      Yes, I love to cook! Well, this recipe calls for beef, potatoes and carrots. Can you tell me where the beef is?", "image": "engenn2le04ob11re2img02.jpg", "id": 2, "time": "7700"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Clerk</span>:      The beef is in that aisle. Why don't I show you? <br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Chelsea</span>:      Thanks, that's very kind of you.<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Clerk</span>:      No problem, ma'am. Here is the meat aisle. These are on sale for $3.50 a pound.", "image": "engenn2le04ob11re2img03.jpg", "id": 3, "time": "22250"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Chelsea</span>:  Hmm ... I don't really like this beef. Is there any chicken?<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Clerk</span>: Yes, over there. Those are fresh.", "image": "engenn2le04ob11re2img01.jpg", "id": 4, "time": "36250"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Chelsea</span>:      OK, where can I find the vegetables? <br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Clerk</span>:      This way. You should buy these potatoes. I like these. The carrots are over there. <br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Chelsea</span>:      Thanks! You are very helpful. Where is the checkout line? Where's my wallet?", "image": "engenn2le04ob11re2img01.jpg", "id": 5, "time": "42000"}], "audiosrc": "engenn2le04ob11re2aud01"}}], "id": 1, "template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "_data": [], "title": ""}, {"contents": [{"type": "p", "value": "Frances always looks for new recipes she can try. She loves to cook! She enjoys some meat dishes, but she really doesn't like beef. "}], "id": 2, "template_override": 1, "type": "text", "_data": [], "title": ""}]}]}